In **11 of 45** sampled claims, one or more expected supporting items were not retained in the official case file, although associates stated the information had been reviewed at the time the claim was worked. Missing or inconsistently retained items included:

- screenshots from **CardView** showing account status or registration information (five cases);
- email correspondence or processor responses from **Corvane Card Services** relating to merchant or network activity (four cases);
- analyst support showing why a duplicate or repeat-claim concern was cleared (two cases).
